# struct-close 2026-10-09 (coordinator batch: qfd_sp_tree_lane, 6+ fails): ostn + two-layer pin spread (PIN_H M4 M6 / PIN_V M5 M7; the d1956 route stopped at the fp lint: W/E M4 15.4 b/um > 12).  The CTS early fails were hold FLOODS (80-82k endpoints inside the 50 ps route hold margin, WNS -0.5 .. -13): route at HM 10 / 0 (option B: FF >= 0 at sign-off).  Layout only, 0 cycles.
# qwen-blocks qfd_sp_tree_lane_ostn: y / fault pin stations + registered level fault ORs (OSTN=1, y +1 cycle)
# Full TCUT7/SMIN7 lane: 48 input positions and 48 output positions; 16 replicas.
TOP=ot_qwen_spine_lane
SRCS='rtl/physical/ot_qwen_spine_lane.sv rtl/hdc/ot_qwen_me_spine_h_w12.sv rtl/hdc/ot_qwen_w12_matvec.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_fastfp.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_fp32_add_lat.sv rtl/hdc/ot_hdc_prefix.sv'
PARAMS=(--param TREE_LAT=7 --param OSTN=1)
FW=600.048
FH=600.048
PINS=(--pin-region '^t_in(\[|$)=left:15-585' --pin-region '^y(\[|$)=right:15-585' --pin-region '^(clk|rst_n|sel_e|tv_e|fault)(\[|$)=bottom:50-550')
INTER='*'
REFGLOB='*tin_q*'
FALSE_FROM='rst_n'
PD=0.55
NC=16
MACROS=()
EXTRA=()
STAGES=pnr
PIN_H='M4 M6'
PIN_V='M5 M7'
